    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that... but it's not just about the money. it's like the whole structure of my life was built on a foundation that didn't exist. i've spent my entire adult life chasing a goal that turned out to be a lie. now i'm just sitting here with nothing to show for it. it feels like i'm just a hollow shell. when you've lost everything you worked for, there's no \"person\" left to find. there's just the loss.",
